==English==
{{wikipedia|martial arts}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|sg=[[martial]] [[art]]}}

# Commonly, any of several fighting styles which contain systematized methods of training for combat, both armed and unarmed; often practiced as a sport, e.g. [[boxing]], [[karate]], [[judo]], [[Silat]], [[wrestling]], or [[Muay Thai]]. Can also include military tactics such as infantry  maneuvers, aerial combat, and so on.

